      "pageDescription": "",
      "evidenceText": "BODS Archive | National Data Library Bus Open Data Service archive The UK Government publishes the live locations of buses in England in GTFS-RT and SIRI-VM formats every 10 seconds but they don’t publish an open archive of the data. Since June 2025 we have been archiving these two formats every 30s. We download the timetables daily. Timetables (daily) GTFS-RT (every ~30s) Over server has around 121 days of storage left. Update As of 2nd November 2026, we will no longer serve or collect SIRI-VM data on the archive. This decision was made to ensure we can continue to collect and provide the more widely used GTFS and GTFS-RT data, free of charge, for the foreseeable future. Licence This data is available under the Open Government Licence v3.0",
