      "id": "fee1edf0b91e0715d1425b8a08a717c4e2f3d8ba3047f1516e0c1d9113324fbd",
      "title": "Surprise, surprise: President Trump suggests the midterms were rigged",
      "url": "https://www.thedailybeast.com/ice-barbie-humiliated-on-fox-news-over-bizarre-boast",
      "category": "uncategorized",
      "checkedAt": "2026-11-10T22:19:16.265Z",
